YWlnbj1kYWlseV9hbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3Bf00fd32e>\n\n*TechCrunch Mobility: Zoox prepares for launch and Uber’s AV empire*:\nWelcome back to TechCrunch Mobility, your hub for the future of\ntransportation and now, more than ever, the role AI is playing in it. Read\nMore\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/46960675.9242/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzA5L3RlY2hjcnVuY2gtbW9iaWxpdHktem9veC1wcmVwYXJlcy1mb3ItbGF1bmNoLWFuZC11YmVycy1hdi1lbXBpcmU_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWRhaWx5X2Ft/6871770a273e032f335072f3B76170bf5>\n\n*Anthropic is turning Claude Code’s auto mode on by default*: Programming\nwith Claude Code will soon require even less human oversight. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/46960675.9242/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzA5L2FudGhyb3BpYy1pcy10dXJuaW5nLWNsYXVkZS1jb2Rlcy1hdXRvLW1vZGUtb24tYnktZGVmYXVsdD91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249ZGFpbHlfYW0/6871770a273e032f335072f3B0d4b60ea>\n\n*OpenAI acquires presentation startup NextSlide*: NextSlide says its team\nmembers are now working on ChatGPT. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/46960675.9242/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzA4L29wZW5haS1hY3F1aXJlcy1wcmVzZW50YXRpb24tc3RhcnR1cC1uZXh0c2xpZGU_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWRhaWx5X2Ft/6871770a273e032f335072f3Bfc5f728a>\nLast but Not Least\n\n[image: Embattled hedge fund Situational Awareness invests $400M in chip\nstartup Source Foundry]\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/46960675.9242/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzA5L2VtYmF0dGxlZC1oZWRnZS1mdW5kLXNpdHVhdGlvbmFsLWF3YXJlbmVzcy1pbnZlc3RzLTQwMG0taW4tY2hpcC1zdGFydHVwLXNvdXJjZS1mb3VuZHJ5P3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1kYWlseV9hbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3B27a49c3d>\n\n*Embattled hedge fund Situational Awareness invests $400M in chip startup\nSource Foundry*: The AI-focused hedge fund is still making some big bets. Read\nMore\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/46960675.9242/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzA5L2VtYmF0dGxlZC1oZWRnZS1mdW5kLXNpdHVhdGlvbmFsLWF3YXJlbmVzcy1pbnZlc3RzLTQwMG0taW4tY2hpcC1zdGFyd